WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.208
[JORDAN]: ONE OF THE THINGS YOU’VE
DONE IS TO PICK SOMEONE TO

00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:06.458
IMITATE AND TO PULL YOURSELF TOWARDS
THEM BY THAT PROCESS OF IMITATION.

00:00:06.458 --> 00:00:08.667
THEN WHEN YOU GOT CLOSE,
YOU PICK SOMEONE ELSE TO

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.375
IMITATE OR TO COMPARE YOURSELF WITH.

00:00:10.375 --> 00:00:11.834
[MIKHAILA]:
COMPARE MYSELF WITH...

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:13.333
[JORDAN]: SURE, BUT IT’S
THE SAME THING.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:14.875
THE COMPARISON IS THE SAME THING.

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:17.583
BECAUSE WHEN YOU COMPARE YOURSELF
TO SOMEONE, YOU START PULLING

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:20.417
YOURSELF TOWARDS THEM, UNLESS YOU
GET ENVIOUS AND RESENTFUL.

00:00:20.417 --> 00:00:22.041
[MIKHAILA]: AND THAT’S WHAT
I’VE DONE THROUGHOUT MY

00:00:22.041 --> 00:00:24.834
LIFE IS, “HEY, THAT PERSON’S
REALLY SMART AND INTERESTING.”

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:26.625
TRY AND ACHIEVE WHAT
THEY’RE ACHIEVING, AND THEN

00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:28.333
ONCE YOU GET THERE, YOU PICK
SOMEBODY ABOVE YOU.

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:31.375
THE PROBLEM IS, THAT MEANS YOU’RE
ALWAYS KIND OF UNFULFILLED, BUT IT

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:32.667
ALSO MEANS YOU’RE ALWAYS GROWING.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:33.875
SO THAT’S WHAT WE
WERE TALKING ABOUT.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.583
[JORDAN]: THAT’S ALSO WHY JUNG
POINTED OUT, FOR EXAMPLE,

00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:39.834
HE BELIEVED THAT THE BOOK OF
REVELATIONS HAD BEEN TACKED ONTO

00:00:39.834 --> 00:00:43.417
THE NEW TESTAMENT, BECAUSE THE
CHRIST IN THE GOSPELS WAS PORTRAYED

00:00:43.417 --> 00:00:44.917
TOO MUCH AS A FIGURE OF MERCY.

00:00:44.917 --> 00:00:48.875
WHEREAS, IN REVELATIONS, CHRIST IS
PORTRAYED PRIMARILY AS A JUDGE,

00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:53.083
AND JUNG’S EXPLANATION FOR THAT
WAS THAT EVERY IDEAL IS A JUDGE.

00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:56.166
THE ULTIMATE IDEAL IS THE
ULTIMATE JUDGE, AND YOU

00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:58.834
COULD SAY THE ULTIMATE
IDEAL JUDGES YOUR SOUL.

00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:01.834
BECAUSE THAT’S VIRTUALLY THE
DEFINITION OF THE ULTIMATE IDEAL.

00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:04.583
SO THE ULTIMATE IDEAL IS
SOMETHING TRANSCENDENT AND

00:01:04.583 --> 00:01:06.750
DIVINE THAT JUDGES YOUR SOUL.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:10.250
NOW WHAT THAT MEANS ABOUT THE
WAY THE UNIVERSE IS CONSTITUTED,

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.750
AGAIN, I HAVE NO IDEA.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:14.208
BUT THE HIGHER THE IDEAL,
THE MORE SEVERE THE JUDGE.

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:17.083
THAT’S CLEARLY THE CASE, AND THAT
SHOULD MAKE YOU QUAKE.

00:01:17.083 --> 00:01:20.166
WHEN YOUR CONSCIENCE ASSAULTS
YOU IN THE MIDDLE OF THE NIGHT FOR

00:01:20.166 --> 00:01:23.750
THINGS THAT YOU’VE DONE WRONG,
IT’S BECAUSE YOU’RE QUAKING IN

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:27.500
YOUR BOOTS, MORALLY, BECAUSE YOU’VE
FAILED TO LIVE UP TO THIS IDEAL.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:29.041
THERE’S NO ESCAPE FROM THAT.

00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:30.708
NOT TRULY.

00:01:30.708 --> 00:01:33.208
I DON’T BELIEVE THERE IS.

